What to check during daily monitoring
Component	What to look for
CPU	Sustained high utilization
Memory	Low available memory or excessive swapping
Disk	Filesystems nearing capacity
Services	Failed or inactive services
Logs	Repeated errors and warnings
Application	Slow response or failed requests
Network	Connectivity problems and timeouts

